# Input

```grit
engine biome(1.0)
language js

`foo($arg)` where {
	$arg <: within `bar($_)`,
	$arg <: within TsExternalModuleDeclaration(),
	$arg <: not within TsExternalModuleDeclaration(),
	$arg <: ! within `bar($_)`,
	$arg <: bubble within `bar($_)`,
	$arg <: within `bar($_)` until `baz($_)`,
	register_diagnostic(span=$arg, message="example")
}

```


